# Report E: the 138-character comment line 7 of z86.a197 (RadioactiveDecay6.1.3)
# makes LoadDecayTable fail: warning HAD_RDM_100 "While loop count exceeded".
# Run with the unmodified example
#   examples/extended/radioactivedecay/rdecay01
# with G4RADIOACTIVEDATA pointing to RadioactiveDecay6.1.3, and look for HAD_RDM_100
# and the "Nb of generated particles" table. With line 7 shortened to fewer than
# 120 characters the warning disappears and the table is the same.
/control/verbose 2
/run/verbose 0
/process/had/rdm/thresholdForVeryLongDecayTime 1.0e+60 year
/run/initialize
/gun/particle ion
/rdecay01/fullChain false
/run/printProgress 0
#
# Rn197 ground state (alpha 100%, Q = 7411 keV)
/gun/ion 86 197
/run/beamOn 2000
